    "lawSection": "Education",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S4211\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act in relation to legalizing, validating, ratifying and confirming\nactions of the Oyster Bay - East Norwich central school district with\nrespect to certain building aid contracts\n\n\n PURPOSE :\nThis legislation would remedy a ministerial filing error on the part\nof the Oyster Bay-East Norwich central school district in relation to\ntheir eligibility for state aid.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\nSection 1 provides for the legislative intent on the legislation.\n\nSection 2 legalizes, validates, ratifies and confirms the Oyster\nBay-East Norwich central school district compliance with the\nrequirements set forth so that they shall receive the appropriate\nstate aid previously allotted to them for certain building projects.\n\nSection 3 provides that this act shall take effect immediately.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nThe Oyster Bay-East Norwich central school district approved several\ncapital improvement projects through the State Education Department\nwhich were deemed eligible for state aid.\n\nDue to ministerial error, however, the proper filing for such aid was\nnever accomplished, and thus, the District became ineligible for such\naid. This legislation seeks to rectify that situation.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nIf not adopted, the Oyster Bay-East Norwich Central School District\nwould suffer a loss of aid totaling approximately $250,000.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
