    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S4211B\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act\nin relation to legalizing, validating, ratifying and confirming actions\nof the Oyster Bay - East Norwich central school district with respect\nto certain building aid contracts\n\nPURPOSE:\nThis legislation would remedy a ministerial\nfiling error on\nthe part of the Oyster Bay-East Norwich central school district in\nrelation to their eligibility for state aid.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\nSection 1 provides for the legislative intent\non the legislation.\n\nSection 2 legalizes, validates, ratifies and confirms the Oyster\nBay-East Norwich central school district compliance with the\nrequirements set forth so that they shall receive the appropriate\nstate aid previously allotted to them for certain building projects.\n\nSection 3 provides that this act shall take effect immediately.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nThe Oyster Bay-East Norwich central school district\napproved several capital improvement projects through the State\nEducation Department which were deemed eligible for state aid.\n\nDue to ministerial error, however, the proper filing for such aid was\nnever accomplished, and thus, the District became ineligible for such\naid. This legislation seeks to rectify that situation.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\nNew bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nIf not adopted, the Oyster Bay-East Norwich\nCentral School District would suffer a loss of aid totaling\napproximately $250,000.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
